# Git worktrees are full checkouts nested inside the repo. Prettier walks them,
# so `pnpm lint` fails locally on a generated file (src/prismicio-types.d.ts)
# that CI never sees, for anyone who happens to have a worktree open. A false
# red is worse than no check — it teaches people to skip the output.
.worktrees

